units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.05 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region unitcell block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 unitcell
create_atoms 1 region unitcell
replicate 5 5 5
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal vol lx ly lz
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
reset_timestep 0
run 10
